<!doctype html>
<html lang="id"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Inventory Mini | Afrijal</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css"></head>
<body><aside><a class="brand" href="./"><span class="logo">i.</span> inventory<span class="light">mini</span></a><small>WORKSPACE / PORTOFOLIO</small><nav><button data-page="dashboard" class="active">◫ &nbsp; Ringkasan</button><button data-page="products">▦ &nbsp; Daftar barang</button><button data-page="history">↔ &nbsp; Riwayat transaksi</button><button data-page="report">▤ &nbsp; Laporan</button></nav><div class="sidebottom"><b>Stok rapi. Kerja tenang.</b><p>Kelola persediaan dengan<br>catatan yang dapat ditelusuri.</p><span>LOCAL DEMO · v1.0</span></div></aside>
<main><header><span>Workspace <span class="muted">/</span> <b id="breadcrumb">Ringkasan</b></span><span class="profile">AI</span></header><div class="content"><div class="heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">INVENTORY MANAGEMENT</span><h1 id="title">Persediaan, dalam kendali.</h1><p id="subtitle">Pantau stok dan setiap pergerakan barang di satu tempat.</p></div><div class="actions"><button id="add" class="secondary">+ Tambah barang</button><button id="transact" class="primary">↔ Catat transaksi</button></div></div>
<div id="notice" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden></div><section id="stats" class="stats"></section>
<section class="panel"><div class="panelhead"><div><h2 id="tabletitle">Daftar persediaan</h2><p id="tablehint">Saldo terkini untuk setiap barang.</p></div><button id="demo" class="secondary">Muat data contoh</button><button id="export" class="secondary" hidden>Unduh CSV</button></div><div class="filters"><label class="search">⌕ <input id="search" aria-label="Cari barang atau SKU" placeholder="Cari nama barang atau SKU..."></label><label id="statuswrap"><select id="status" aria-label="Filter status stok"><option value="all">Semua status</option><option value="low">Stok menipis</option><option value="zero">Stok habis</option></select></label><div id="dates" hidden><label>Dari <input type="date" id="from"></label><label>Sampai <input type="date" id="to"></label></div></div><div class="tablewrap"><table><thead id="thead"></thead><tbody id="tbody"></tbody></table></div><div class="panelfoot"><span id="count"></span><span id="footnote">Saldo diperbarui setelah transaksi berhasil.</span></div></section>
<div class="bottomgrid" id="bottom"><section class="tip"><span class="eyebrow">PERSEDIAAN SEHAT</span><h3>Jangan sampai kehabisan.</h3><p>Atur batas minimum tiap barang untuk membantu merencanakan pembelian berikutnya.</p></section><section class="panel activity"><h2>Aktivitas terbaru</h2><div id="recent"></div></section></div><footer>Portofolio Afrijal Indra Hendrawan · Dikembangkan dengan bantuan AI <span>PHP · SQLite · AI-assisted development</span></footer></div></main>
<dialog id="dialog"><form id="form"><div class="dialoghead"><h2 id="dialogtitle"></h2><button type="button" id="close" aria-label="Tutup">×</button></div><div id="fields"></div><p id="formerror" role="alert"></p><button class="primary save" type="submit">Simpan</button></form></dialog><script src="app.js"></script></body></html>

